{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Do you know the statutes of heaven</b> — that I have set. This is what the poet said: \"He set a statute that shall not pass.\"" "<b>Its dominion</b> — refers back to heaven, because they have dominion over the earth by means of officers."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:04.481421916Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}